    "updated_at": "2025-05-20T13:51:24Z",
    "body": "> The core remaining question for me is about `Window` object reuse. In [web-platform-tests/wpt#51895](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/51895) [@annevk](https://github.com/annevk) has a test which seems to indicate the `Window` object is not reused in the way the spec indicates, at least in WebKit and Blink.\n\nWebKit resets the custom element registry in [LocalDOMWindow::didSecureTransitionTo](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/2a64f298232389bf262c7d85229c12dba360fea1/Source/WebCore/page/LocalDOMWindow.cpp#L450) when re-using the window. \n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
